# MASTER3-OPENAPI-001: sha256 (LF-normalised) of every file under openapi/ at the CONTRACT_FREEZE state (Gate B-E amendments FA1..FA5
# plus FA6 = MASTER2-API-002 text change in profiles.yaml and errors.yaml, plus FA7 = MASTER5-OPENAPI-001 ETag response header on D1-11/12/13 in profiles.yaml, plus FA8 = MASTER6-IDEM-003 optional expectedRoleIds precondition on D1-26 in profiles.yaml, plus FA9 = MASTER6-OPENAPI-005 text-only nombreMostrar rules on AdminUserPatchRequest in profiles.yaml, plus FA10 = RC-12 text/maximum-only OffsetStrict parameter of D1-22 in pagination.yaml and profiles.yaml, plus FA11 = new news/news.yaml (D4-01..D4-11) and wallet/wallet.yaml (D6-01, D6-02) wired into root.yaml, NoticiaIdPath in identifiers.yaml and the OFFSET comment of pagination.yaml, plus FA12 = new moderation/moderation.yaml (moderation reads D5-20, D5-21, D5-22, D5-25, D5-26, D5-28, D5-29) and commerce/commerce.yaml (admin subscription list D7-27) wired into root.yaml, plus FA13 = admin catalog reads D7-17, D7-21, D6-18, D6-20, D6-22 and catalog upserts D7-22, D7-19 added to commerce/commerce.yaml and new dashboard/dashboard.yaml (dashboard overview D3-15) wired into root.yaml, plus FA14 = promotion use log D7-29 added to commerce/commerce.yaml and wired into root.yaml, plus FA15 = new billing/billing.yaml (billing history D7-05) and community/community.yaml (OposiRed categories D5-01, own OposiTester counters D5-16) and the product upsert D7-18 added to commerce/commerce.yaml, all wired into root.yaml, plus FA16 = DEC-015 decided by the owner on 2026-10-13 (the correction is revealed when the user answers, for the three exam types) in attempts/attempts.yaml: optional nullable esCorrecta and opcionCorrectaId added to AttemptQuestion.respuesta (D2-08) and text-only descriptions of D2-08, D2-09, AttemptGridItem.estado (D2-07) and AnswerResult.esCorrecta / opcionCorrectaId (D2-09); no operation, required field or error code added), plus FA17 = owner plan of 2026-10-14 (single explicit password unit) in auth/auth.yaml and profiles/profiles.yaml: the auth Password schema (NEW passwords: register D1-01, reset D1-10) becomes 12..72 characters of printable ASCII (maxLength 72, pattern ^[\x20-\x7E]{12,72}$, description), LoginRequest.password moves to a new LoginPassword schema that keeps the historical 12..128 bounds so existing passwords still log in, and CredentialsChangeRequest.newPassword gets the same 12..72 printable-ASCII rule; no operation, response, required field or error code added (INVALID_PASSWORD stays the canonical issue). plus FA18 = E1 exam-server amendment 2026-10-14 (owner decisions: immutable question revision bound at start, resources V1 image/audio, E2-S01 read limit; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER) in attempts/attempts.yaml and root.yaml: NEW operation D2-66 GET /api/v1/app/intentos/{attemptId}/recursos/{recursoId} (AttemptResourceAccess), NEW schemas AttemptResource / AudioEnvelope / AttemptResourceAccess, optional AttemptQuestion.recursos (D2-08), ReviewItem.resources items now AttemptResource (D2-65, previously always empty), RATE_LIMITED + 429 added to D2-07, D2-08 and D2-12, descriptions of D2-08 / D2-12 / D2-65 updated (content from the bound revision), plus FA19 = PHASE B 2026-10-14 in catalog/catalog.yaml: optional nullable AppExamDetail.ultimoIntentoFinalizadoId (D2-02, PERF01) and text-only descriptions of D2-02 and D2-17 (D2-17 now served by Ktor); no operation, required field or error code added. plus FA20 = E2-P02 PHASE B 2026-10-14 per-user read limits (CATALOG_READ 120/60 s shared by D2-01, D2-02, D2-13, D7-02; WALLET_READ 60/60 s shared by D6-01, D6-02): RATE_LIMITED + 429 added to D2-02 and D2-13 in catalog/catalog.yaml, D7-02 in entitlements/entitlements.yaml, D6-01 and D6-02 in wallet/wallet.yaml (D2-01 already declared it); no operation, field or schema added. plus FA21 = V1 STEP 2 2026-10-15 community mandatory (owner): optional nullable comunidadNombre (readable name) added to D2-01 AppExamSummary, D2-02 AppExamDetail, D2-13 MyExamRef and the D2-13 groups in catalog/catalog.yaml; AdminExamenCreateRequest now REQUIRES comunidadId and AdminExamenPatchRequest.comunidadId can no longer be null (422 EXAM_COMMUNITY_REQUIRED / UNKNOWN_COMMUNITY, 409 EXAM_PUBLISH_REQUIRES_COMMUNITY); no operation added. plus FA22 = V1 economy 2026-10-15 (owner scope change): new economy/economy.yaml adds as TARGET the OposiTickets commands D6-03 redeem, D6-11 packs, D6-12/D6-13/D6-14 payment orders and W-01 provider webhook (root.yaml paths and the payments tag), the economy error codes (errors.yaml EconomyErrorCode) and ErrorDetails.balance and ErrorDetails.price, plus optional nullable accesoValidoHasta on D2-02 AppExamDetail and the D2-13 MyExamItem and the ExamPrice meaning (OT price from the database, null when not purchasable) in catalog/catalog.yaml. plus FA23 = owner 2026-10-16: the specialty is set once (D1-13 409 SPECIALTY_ALREADY_SET) and is an access gate (D2-02/D2-03/D6-03 404 for another specialty, D2-01/D2-13 scoped to it), ORDER_PENDING_LIMIT. plus FA24 = E3 Reportar 2026-10-16: D5-15 POST /api/v1/app/feedback/pregunta published as a non-deprecated contract in community/community.yaml (intentoId required, optional Idempotency-Key with replay semantics, per-user limits). plus FA25 = E5-V1-F02 2026-10-16 refund policy P2 text in economy/economy.yaml (W-01: result REFUNDED_P2 replaces REFUNDED_CASE_OPEN, 503 also when the refund path is switched off). plus FA26 = Guardar + OposiTeca V1 2026-10-16 (E1-V1-SAVED-CONTRACT.md): new opositeca/opositeca.yaml (D4-20 PUT and D4-21 DELETE guardados/{tipo}/{targetId}, D4-24 GET opositeca, D4-26 GET guardados/{tipo}; tipo = pregunta only) wired into root.yaml with the opositeca tag, and SAVED_LIMIT_REACHED in errors.yaml. plus FA27/FA28 = V1 Access v2 2026-10-16 (E1-V1-ACCESS-V2-DESIGN.md): new plan/plan.yaml (D7-31 GET plan/cupo, D7-32 PUT plan/cupo/{examenId}); attempts.yaml D2-03 modo DEMO documented live, Attempt.esDemo, D2-08 DAILY_LIMIT_REACHED; economy.yaml TicketPack recargaBase and otPorEuro; errors.yaml PLAN_QUOTA_NONE, PLAN_QUOTA_FULL, EXAM_NOT_IMMERSIVE, DAILY_LIMIT_REACHED. plus FA28 text 2026-10-16: Result resumen.esDemo, PURCHASE_CAP_REACHED (daily cap on OT bought). plus FA29 = V1 wave 2 2026-10-16 (E1-V1-ENGAGEMENT-DESIGN.md v2.1): new engagement/engagement.yaml (D3-16 GET retos/hoy, D3-17 PUT retos/{retoId}/respuestas/{preguntaId}, D3-18 POST retos/{retoId}/reclamar, D3-04 GET racha (D2-05/D2-06 marked superseded in attempts.yaml)), tag challenge in root.yaml, codes RETO_OUT_OF_WINDOW, RETO_NOT_PASSED, OT_EARN_CAP_REACHED in errors.yaml. plus FA30 = V1 wave 1/2 amendments 2026-10-16: plan/plan.yaml D7-33 GET plan/catalogo (plan catalog: coverage, 24 h limit and standard tariffs as data, E4-V1-PLAN-SCREEN.md); engagement/engagement.yaml D3-19 GET retos/{retoId}/preguntas/{preguntaId}/recursos/{recursoId} (challenge media bound to the reto), ChallengeQuestion.recursos, ChallengeReward.pendiente, D3-18 all-or-nothing deferral semantics, gates and 422 RETO_CLAIM_EXPIRED / 403 RETO_CLAIM_NOT_ELIGIBLE / EMAIL_UNVERIFIED (E2 R-1, W-4, W-6, W-9); errors.yaml RETO_CLAIM_EXPIRED, RETO_CLAIM_NOT_ELIGIBLE. plus FA31 = V1 official exams 2026-10-16 (annulled and reserve questions, E1-V1-OFFICIAL-RULES-CONTRACT.md), additive in attempts/attempts.yaml: AttemptGridItem.rol/sustituyeA and estado reserva_no_utilizada (finished attempts only), AttemptQuestion.rol/sustituyeA (D2-08), result resumen nota nullable plus evaluables/anuladas/reservasUsadas/anuladasSinReserva/reglaAnuladas/penalizacion (D2-10, D2-12), result question estado/rol/sustituyeA, ReviewItem.status RESERVA_NO_UTILIZADA plus rol/sustituyeA (D2-65); errors.yaml OFFICIAL_RULES_INVALID. plus FA32 = V1 wave 3 2026-10-16 (stats, E1-V1-W3-CONTRACT.md): new stats/stats.yaml (D3-20 GET estadisticas/resumen, D3-21 GET estadisticas/debilidades, D3-22 GET estadisticas/dificultad/{preguntaId}), tag stats in root.yaml, plus D3-23 POST admin/estadisticas/recalcular (audited admin recompute with cooldown), errors.yaml STATS_SCOPE_INVALID and STATS_RECOMPUTE_COOLDOWN. plus FA33 = V1 wave 4 2026-10-16 (ranking, E1-V1-W4-CONTRACT.md): new ranking/ranking.yaml (D3-24 GET ranking, D3-25 PUT ranking/visibilidad), tag ranking in root.yaml, errors.yaml USERNAME_REQUIRED, D3-23 alcance ranking. plus FA34 = V1 wave 5 referral 2026-10-17 (E1-V1-W5-REFERRAL-CONTRACT.md): new referral/referral.yaml (invitation code, attach, list of rewarded invitees, handles only), tag referral in root.yaml. plus FA35 = V1 wave 5b foro 2026-10-17 (E1-V1-W5-FORO-CONTRACT.md): new foro/foro.yaml (channels, posts, comments, votes, reports, images), tag foro in root.yaml. plus FA36 = rational penalty 2026-10-17 (E1-V1-PENALTY-CONTRACT.md), additive: attempts.yaml Penalizacion.tipo FIJA|RACIONAL plus descuento (in units of correct answers) on the result resumen (D2-12), catalog.yaml exam penalizacion (D2-02). plus FA37 = bulk import with reserves 2026-10-18 (E1-V1-CONTROL-SPEC-IMPORT.md): admin API only, no OpenAPI change. plus FA38 = razonado rich text 2026-10-18 (E1-V1-MARKUP-CONTRACT.md), additive in attempts/attempts.yaml: schema RichText, D2-65 explanation.razonamientoRico and D2-12 preguntas[].razonamientoRico (served only with EXPLANATIONS_VISIBLE). plus FA39 = email-link code binding 2026-10-18 (E1-V1-NIGHT-PKCE.md), additive in auth/auth.yaml: codeChallenge on RegisterRequest/EmailWithCaptchaRequest, codeVerifier and email on EmailExchangeRequest/ResetPasswordRequest. plus FA40 = CERT-LOAD-1000 overload admission 2026-10-21 (OposiControl branch fix/v1-overload-admission-control; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER), additive in common/errors.yaml: GenericErrorCode SERVER_BUSY (503, always with Retry-After, nothing applied) and the UpstreamUnavailable description, and (OposiControl review 2026-10-22) a 503 UpstreamUnavailable response declared on every bot-profile operation that lacked it (attempts, catalog, entitlements, profiles); no operation, field or schema added. plus FA41 = CERT-LOAD-1000 shutdown drain 2026-10-21 (same branch, CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER), additive in foundation/foundation.yaml: D8-07 GET /health/live may answer 503 with LivenessStatus.status DRAINING during the shutdown drain (x-error-envelope-exempt like D8-08). plus FA42 = profile photo 2026-11-08 (owner decision; OposiControl branch f3/avatar; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER): profiles/profiles.yaml D1-14 PUT /api/v1/app/me/avatar and D1-15 DELETE implemented (x-slice 5); D1-14 request body changed from multipart/form-data (AvatarUpload, image/webp) to the RAW image (image/jpeg or image/png, 1..2000000 bytes), 422 IMAGE_REJECTED and VALIDATION/ACCOUNT_DELETION_PENDING/PROFILE_MISSING/UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE listed, schema AvatarUpload removed, AvatarResponse unchanged, MeProfile.avatarUrl text; additive: optional nullable avatarUrl (signed) on ranking/ranking.yaml top3 items (D3-24) and foro/foro.yaml ForoAutor (D5-03/04/05/06). plus FA43 = Home top bar 2026-11-08 (OposiControl branch f2/level-ot-today, migration 20261108100100; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER), additive in engagement/engagement.yaml: new schema StreakView (the Streak fields plus optional nullable liga {codigo, nombre, orden} and otHoy {ganados, tope}) as the D3-04 GET racha 200 body, and the D3-04 description; Streak (used by D3-16 and D3-17) unchanged; no operation, required field or error code added. plus FA44 = automatic demo 2026-11-08 (OposiControl branch f14/auto-demo, migration 20261108100300; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER), text-only in attempts/attempts.yaml: D2-03 modo DEMO, Attempt.esDemo and the result esDemo now describe the EFFECTIVE demo set (the complete set flagged by Control, otherwise automatically the first N main non-annulled active questions by position; fewer than N = no demo) and the default-on demo with explicit opt-out; no operation, field, schema, required field or error code added. plus FA45 = F15 exam access route 2026-11-08 (owner decision; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record in the OposiBot repo), additive in catalog/catalog.yaml: new schema TurnoAcceso (nullable closed set libre, promocion_interna, estabilizacion, discapacidad; unknown = null for clients) and optional nullable turnoAcceso on AppExamSummary (D2-01), AppExamDetail (D2-02), MyExamItem.examen (D2-13) and AdminExamen / AdminExamenCreateRequest / AdminExamenPatchRequest; no operation, required field or error code added. plus FA46 = F20 daily challenge per exam type 2026-11-09 (owner decision; OposiControl branch f20/reto-per-type, migration 20261109100000; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER in the OposiBot repo), text-only in engagement/engagement.yaml: the header, D3-17 and DailyChallenge.necesarios now describe a reto of 1 to 3 questions (one per exam type with published questions of the specialty, empty types skipped) won with ceil(2n/3) correct; no operation, field, schema, required field or error code added. plus FA48 = F20b daily challenge always 3 questions 2026-11-11 (owner decision; OposiControl branch f20b/reto-tres, migration 20261109100200; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER in the OposiBot repo; FA47 is taken by F23), text-only header of engagement/engagement.yaml: after one question per exam type the reto is filled up to 3 from the other eligible questions of the specialty (tipoSlot can repeat; fewer than 3 eligible = what exists); no operation, field, schema, required field or error code added. plus FA48 = random fixed demo set 2026-11-11 (OposiControl branch f14b/demo-aleatoria, migration 20261111100000; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER), text-only in attempts/attempts.yaml: the D2-03 modo DEMO automatic set is N questions picked at random but fixed per exam (same for every user and start; amended 2026-11-14: chosen once at publication and stored, so adding questions never changes it; only an ineligible member is replaced, by the next of that fixed order, and the replacement stays) instead of the first N by position; no operation, field, schema, required field or error code added. plus FA47 = F23 quick practice tests 2026-11-09 (owner decision; OposiControl branch f23/quick-quiz, migration 20261109100100; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER in the OposiBot repo), additive in attempts/attempts.yaml and root.yaml: NEW operations D2-67 GET /api/v1/app/practicas/disponibilidad (QuickQuizAvailability) and D2-68 POST /api/v1/app/practicas (QuickQuizStartRequest, 201 AttemptStartResponse with intento.origen QUICK_QUIZ, examenId null), text of Attempt.esDemo (never true on a practice attempt); the practice attempt then uses D2-07..D2-12, D2-65 and D2-66 unchanged; no field, required field or error code added to existing schemas. FA47b = F23 practice from chosen exams 2026-11-14 (owner plan "Generar examen"; OposiControl branch f23/quick-quiz, migration 20261114200100; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER in the OposiBot repo), additive in attempts/attempts.yaml only: optional QuickQuizStartRequest.examenIds (1..50 distinct uuids), NEW per-contract error code PRACTICE_EXAM_NOT_ACCESSIBLE (422) on D2-68, NEW required response field QuickQuizAvailability.examenesAdquiridos (D2-67, distinct exams of D2-13 vista=ADQUIRIDOS). plus FA49 = F25 app news 2026-11-11 (owner decision; OposiControl branch f25/news-app; no migration: the news tables are already on MAIN; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER in the OposiBot repo), additive: NEW news/news-app.yaml with D4-18 GET /api/v1/app/noticias (AppNews, cursor) and D4-27 GET /api/v1/app/noticias/{noticiaId} (AppNewsItem), schemas AppNoticia and AppNoticiaCapa (images only as signed URLs), wired into root.yaml with the tag news and one sentence in info.description; no existing operation, field, required field or error code changed. plus FA53 = preset avatars 2026-11-14 (owner decision, plan 1.3 section 8; OposiControl branch f29/avatar-preset, migration 20261114100000; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER in the OposiBot repo), additive: profiles/profiles.yaml D1-14 PUT /api/v1/app/me/avatar also accepts application/json AvatarPresetRequest {avatarId 1..10} (new schema; 422 AVATAR_ID_INVALID, new code in common/errors.yaml), the raw photo upload stays but is off by default (415), AvatarResponse gains avatarId and its fields become optional, MeProfile.avatarId, D1-15 also clears the preset; ranking/ranking.yaml top3[].avatarId and foro/foro.yaml ForoAutor.avatarId (nullable, same gates as avatarUrl). FA50 = F30 saved question detail 2026-11-14 (owner plan "Biblioteca"; OposiControl branch f30/biblioteca-desde, migration 20261114200000; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER in the OposiBot repo), additive in opositeca/opositeca.yaml and root.yaml: NEW operations D4-29 (renumbered from D4-27 at the 1.3 server integration 2026-11-14: D4-27 is the F25 app news detail) GET /api/v1/app/opositeca/guardados/{tipo}/{targetId} (the read of the D4-20/D4-21 resource, tipo = pregunta; SavedQuestionDetail = attempts ReviewItem + examenId, examenTitulo, tipoExamen, anulada; no quota) and D4-28 GET /api/v1/app/opositeca/guardados/{tipo}/{targetId}/recursos/{recursoId} (AttemptResourceAccess), optional SavedQuestion.tipoExamen, D4-24 text (exam choice shared with D4-29: an item annulled in every accessible exam is now accesible). FA51 = F30 desde on D2-08 2026-11-14 (owner plan "Entrar al examen mas rapido"; same branch, no migration), additive in attempts/attempts.yaml: optional query parameter desde (1-based posicion, 1..200, exclusive with cursor = 400 VALIDATION issue MUTUALLY_EXCLUSIVE) and D2-08 text; daily-limit semantics unchanged. FA51b = F30 first page inline on D2-03 2026-11-14 (owner plan "Entrar al examen mas rapido", measured by the client: a new attempt was 2 round trips), additive in attempts/attempts.yaml: optional query parameters incluirPreguntas (boolean) and desde (1..200) on D2-03, optional AttemptStartResponse.preguntas (the D2-08 CursorPage for that position, same daily-limit semantics; absent when not asked for or not servable) and D2-03 text. plus FA52 = F28 Market consumables 2026-11-14 (owner decision, plan section 6; OposiControl branch f28/consumibles, migrations 20261114400000..; CONTRACT_FREEZE.md record PENDING_OWNER in the OposiBot repo), additive in commerce/commerce.yaml: optional visible, posicion, seccion (OPOSITICKETS|POTENCIADORES|SERVICIOS), usos, duracion_horas and multiplicador on the admin Servicio item (D6-18); economy/economy.yaml NEW operations D6-39 GET /api/v1/app/market/servicios (MarketCatalogResponse: at most three sections OPOSITICKETS, POTENCIADORES, SERVICIOS with MarketItem and the caller remaining uses) and D6-40 POST /api/v1/app/wallet/servicios/{codigo}/canje (Idempotency-Key required, optional ServiceRedeemRequest.expectedPrice guard, ServiceRedeemResponse saldoTickets + ServiceActivation; 404 NOT_FOUND, 409 INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE / PRICE_CHANGED, 422 NOT_PURCHASABLE) wired into root.yaml; engagement/engagement.yaml: optional usarOportunidad on DailyChallengeAnswerRequest (D3-17), DailyChallengeAnswerResult.opcionCorrectaId no longer required (absent only while a wrong answer is HELD by a doble/triple oportunidad) and respondidas minimum 0, optional oportunidad (ChallengeRetryOffer) and consumiblesUsados, ChallengeReward.multiplicador and extraPotenciador, ChallengeQuestion.oportunidadPendiente, DailyChallenge.protectorUsado and consumibles (ChallengeConsumables), and the D3-17 / D3-18 descriptions (protectors on a failed reto, potenciador on the base reward, claim of a protected FALLADO reto); no error code added. plus FA51b-idem = 1.3 server integration 2026-11-14 (coordinator request), text-only in attempts/attempts.yaml (incluirPreguntas): the inline page asked for (incluirPreguntas / desde, semantic form) is part of the D2-03 Idempotency-Key fingerprint, same key + same query = replay, same key + another inline request = 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED (already a D2-03 error code); no operation, field, schema, required field or error code added. plus FA50b = review Control 2026-11-14 (B1), text-only in opositeca/opositeca.yaml: D4-29 serves the solution (correctAnswer, explanation) only once the caller resolved the question (an answer of theirs with an option or a finished attempt of theirs with it), otherwise both null and still 200; an unused reserve link is never chosen; the save (D4-xx POST guardados) needs the question revealed to the caller; no operation, field, schema, required field or error code added. plus FA52b = review Control 2026-11-14 (C2, C3, C4): engagement/engagement.yaml NEW optional DailyChallengeAnswerRequest.admiteOportunidad (D3-17; absent/null/false = the answer is never held and usarOportunidad is ignored, so older clients never get stuck) and D3-17 / D3-18 text (the potenciador and a tickets-only protector are reserved at answer time and spent by a successful claim; a refused claim spends nothing); economy/economy.yaml D6-40 text (modo_papel and carta_ccaa_comodin are NOT purchasable in 1.3: 422 NOT_PURCHASABLE, D6-39 comprableConTickets false); no operation, required field or error code added. A contract edit, committed or not, changes a hash and
# fails OpenApiFreezeManifestTest; the amendment is then recorded in CONTRACT_FREEZE.md (OposiBot repo) and this manifest updated
